  description: "(This card is always treated as an \"Exodd\" and \"Obliterate!!!\"
    card.)\r\nIf you control a Level 10 or higher \"Exodia\" monster: Destroy all
    cards your opponent controls. If this card is in your GY, except the turn it
    was sent there: You can banish it, then activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF
    Add 1 \"Forbidden One\" monster from your Deck or GY to your hand.\r\n\u25CF
    Shuffle up to 5 \"Forbidden One\" monsters from your GY and/or banishment into
    the Deck.\r\nYou can only use each effect of \"Exxod Fires of Rage\" once per
    turn."
